WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:06.846
Start on Overview. See this week's workload and progress,
then scroll down to decide what to tackle today.

2
00:00:07.348 --> 00:00:12.809
In Weekly Plan, open a task to see its time estimate, what
to do, and links to get started.

3
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.961
Check it off when you're done. Weekly Review shows what
finished and what still needs time.

4
00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:23.539
Rate your skills, find courses, and use the portfolio
checklist to plan your case studies.

5
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:30.760
Build your resume and LinkedIn profile. In Resume Tailor,
paste a posting to compare its keywords with your resume.

6
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:37.063
Use Interview Prep to rehearse. Then add a role in
Applications to track its status and your next step.

7
00:00:38.577 --> 00:00:44.188
Keep networking and events in view. In What's New, save a
useful article straight to your library.

8
00:00:45.619 --> 00:00:53.790
In Settings, rebuild the plan around your hours and
experience. Supported desktop Chrome can also offer private,
on-device AI.
